{"id":"vod_md_5524","vodId":"5524","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"精灵使的剑舞","name_cn":"精灵使的剑舞","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231001-1/ad81fb41f84813b2404ad88b5caee035.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在艾雷西亚精灵学院之中，在这里学习深造的都是出身名门的千金大小姐们，她们要学会如何成为一名合格的精灵使。风早神人（古川慎 配音）是一名平凡的十六岁少年，一次意外之中，他撞见了少女克雷尔（木户衣吹 配音）出浴时的模样，又在误打误撞之中和她签订了契约，就这样，风早神人成为了学院之中唯一的男性精灵使。成熟可靠温文尔雅的琳丝蕾特（优木加奈 配音），一本正经循规蹈矩的艾莉丝（石上静香 配音），表面看来大大咧咧但内心却十分娇羞的菲雅娜（大西沙织 配音），在这些可爱女孩子们的围绕下，神人会有着怎样趣味横生的校园生活呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-01 07:13:32","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/eOqdTV1G/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/OCMYgXFh/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/TWqplIk9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/JFvj30Ud/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/ZRfHw218/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/g7B8a3Zd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/9ERZYrsj/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/hJwIUkhx/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/ivVyltA6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/XRtSzraP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/h0ccBWzy/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230930/YSKTLAhm/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:34:09.447Z"}